        "original_id": "8d6fc0d6-aba4-5e0d-9089-f784e570a2d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The AXIS, Planet Hollywood Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States\n- Organizations: Caesars Entertainment Corporation, Miss Universe\n- Events: Miss Universe 2015\n- People: Gloria Diaz, Vic Vargas, Elizabeth Oropesa\n- Works: Ang Pinakamagandang Hayop sa Balat ng Lupa\n\nFacts:\n- Planet Hollywood Las Vegas is owned and operated by Caesars Entertainment Corporation.\n- Gloria Diaz won the Miss Universe title in 1969.\n- The film Ang Pinakamagandang Hayop sa Balat ng Lupa starred Gloria Diaz, Vic Vargas, and Elizabeth Oropesa.\n- Miss Universe 2015 was the 64th Miss Universe pageant and was held on 20 December 2015 at The AXIS in Las Vegas, Nevada, United States.\n- The AXIS, also called The AXIS powered by Monster for sponsorship and the AXIS Theater, is a mid-sized auditorium at Planet Hollywood Las Vegas on the Las Vegas Strip.",
